    "estimators": "Tier A/B fraction and median interface_delta among A/B are primary; best-three mean secondary; single best sensitivity-only. Directional comparisons use \u00b12 REU and \u00b120% experimental no-call tolerances; bootstrap uses 20,000 iterations.",
