    "metrics": "d1,d2,d3,a1,t1,t2,Herschlag phi, confidence, ligand ipTM, affinity prediction/probability, interface_delta, geometry tier/rank; score_source is amber_openmm.",
    "pa66_stratum": "PA6,6 L2z -> L1z; 9 arms (WT plus eight singles), 50 target model indices per arm, 450 selected rows. Separate campaign and substrate; analyze within this stratum.",
    "pa6_stratum": "PA6 L4z -> L2; 9 arms (WT plus eight singles), 50 target model indices per arm, 450 selected rows. Analyze within this stratum.",
    "protocol_metadata": "Plan declares independent one-diffusion-sample Boltz invocation per model index with explicit seeds, 200 sampling steps, three recycling steps, cached full MSAs, original contact restraints, then relaxation and Rosetta interface_delta scoring. Logs identify Boltz2 and Amber/OpenMM relaxation/score source; ligand parameter log states inferred net charge 0 and GAFF atom types. Exact ligand protonation state / parameter quality were not certifiable from these summaries; verify actual ligand MOL2/parameter provenance before using as a scientific stratum."
  },
